--- !u!114 &93124581
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 93124578}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "He's SUPER happy to comply now. \nIt happened like this: \nHe received
    a S.O.S MIKE SMS at 03.46 but when he arrived, he didn't found a car nor a tricycle,
    but a giant cow-thing taking a driver out of a crashed truck. \n\" <link>Mora</link>
    had the heebie-jeebies all the way there\". \nSomething was glowing at the back
    of the vehicle. \"I like shiny things, you can't sue me\". So he began to aproach
    it when suddenly a flush of green stuff came out all at once from there and he
    heard \"the roar of gorilla\" so he turned back home as fast as Mora could take
    me.  \nSays he couldn't get a clear look at the <link>thing</link> that came
    out of the <link>truck</link>,  but when he looked back he found himself being
    double followed. \n\"Ever been chased by a <link>7-foot tall cow</link> and it's
    <link>intergalactic friend</link> down the <link>road</link> in the middle of
    a moonless night?\" \nThey ran behind him for a while but IT took to the <u>EAST</u>
    near the crossroads, maybe it was looking for a place to hide after it fed. \n\nHe
    thinks it ate the <link>cow</link>. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
